WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A scientific story can sound complete before it is proven.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
We know audio has frequencies, and the brain has rhythms.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
But those facts do not establish what a particular recording does.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
In one review of fourteen binaural-beat EEG studies, results were inconsistent.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The missing step is a fair test of the actual product and the claimed outcome.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try the free exercise, check the evidence, and choose without pressure.
